Hibernate & JPA Interview Questions for 10 Years of Experience
For a Senior Java Developer with 10 years of experience, Hibernate and JPA interviews usually focus on ORM internals, entity relationships, transaction management, SQL performance, caching, concurrency, and real-world production issues.
Below is a 250-question interview preparation bank, organized by topic and priority for Java Developer, Senior Java Developer, and Tech Lead interviews.
Priority guide
P1
Must prepare first
Entity lifecycle, relationships, fetching, cascading, transactions, N+1 queries, caching.



P2
Senior-level depth
Dirty checking, persistence context, locking, batching, pagination, transaction propagation.



P3
Advanced topics
Inheritance mapping, custom types, Envers, multi-tenancy, production troubleshooting.



